  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. WI-digaj (e436ecd67f C++, 435f4b47bb C#, 2026-10-18) moved the dispatch decision from per-hop to per-method. Filed fixture: cpp now emits Shape.area -> Fancy.area and Square.area -> Fancy.area as well as Shape.area -> Square.area; the C# analogue (abstract CShape, CSquare, CFancy with override) emits all three. Precision control: a non-virtual Base/Mid/Leaf f() chain emits no dispatches_to edge. The concrete-intermediate gap no longer reproduces. MECHANISM: was: extends hop admitted per hop (abstract endpoint); now dispatch is decided per method from virtual/override (WI-digaj). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-digaj (done). PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # cbaf
